  "prefLabel": "Mec 102.09 Fuel gas fitter",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 102.09 “Fuel gas fitter” means “fuel gas fitter” as defined in RSA 153:27, III, namely, “a hearth system installation and service technician, a domestic appliance technician, a fuel gas installation technician, a fuel gas service technician, or a fuel gas piping installer regulated by this subdivision.”\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15; ss by #13483, eff 1-9-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 102.04) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
